assets.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept
Asset type: production pixel-art environment detail atlas for a 3/4 top-down fantasy RPG, The Hollow.
Primary request: exactly 16 full isolated objects in a precise 4x4 equal grid on a square transparent canvas. Each cell equal size, every object fits fully in its cell with generous 24 pixel transparent margins and baseline 85% down in cell. No text, labels, lines, UI, background or ground tiles.
Style: beautiful detailed handcrafted pixel art, crisp individual clustered pixels, muted jewel colors, warm light upper-left, three-quarter overhead game view, tangible natural materials, consistent scale-independent silhouettes. Match a cozy-but-strange fey woodland RPG. Must be readable scaled to 32 to 90 pixels in game.
Row 1:
1 a sourheart tree with red-brown scarred bark, dark purple copper leaves, amber sap tears and exposed roots.
2 a hollow-host tree with green leaves, a stout trunk with many little round insect chambers, honey-colored resin and ants maintaining the bark.
3 a bellroot tree with unusual tall fluted roots, teal hanging foliage and hollow roots curving into arches.
4 a lush cluster of large curled fern fronds in jade green with a few pale tips.
Row 2:
1 lantern orchid cluster, long curving dark leaves, luminous small amber lantern-shaped flowers;
2 crownbloom patch, three huge white-and-rose daisies with bright yellow-green hearts, thick leaves;
3 a heap of autumn leaf litter with small ochre bracket mushrooms, chestnut shells and tiny white sprouts;
4 a dense cluster of orange, brown, and cream woodland mushrooms of varied sizes.
Row 3:
1 snowbell cluster, ice-blue hollow bell flowers with snowy leaves and a faint pale cyan center;
2 a dense thorn bush, gnarled purple-brown branches, muted red berries and small curled leaves;
3 a tuft of riverside reeds and cattails with dark green leaves;
4 a wide colorful low patch of meadow wildflowers, cream yellow and pink blossoms, soft moss.
Row 4:
1 a small stone village well with a mossy shingle canopy, rope and wooden bucket;
2 a rustic wooden two-wheeled handcart loaded with tied sacks, logs and a folded green blanket;
3 a tiny traveler camp prop group, green bedroll, wicker backpack, copper cooking pot on tripod over a few ember stones, all a compact group;
4 a broad low stone retaining ledge made of layered craggy gray rock, a flat mossy grass top with little roots, for decorating a raised meadow terrace.
Constraints: 16 isolated props, exact regular 4 by 4 grid, true transparent background, no shadow outside sprite bounds, no neighboring-cell overlap, no ground plane, no people or creatures.
